   "q": "However, with a weaker than anticipated performance in Life Sciences due to continued destocking in Crop Protection and consumer health, and no signs of an immediate recovery in Crop Protection, we now expect Group adjusted profit before tax to be between £260m and £280m in full year 2024 at constant currency.",
